  "instructions": [
    "In a large bowl, combine ikura, bhuna lentils, mixed citrus juice, salt, black pepper, and aji amarillo pepper. Mix well to combine.",
    "Add the chopped cilantro, minced garlic, and sliced ginger to the bowl and stir to combine.",
    "Cover the bowl with plastic wrap and refrigerate for at least 30 minutes to allow the flavors to meld.",
    "Just before serving, stir in the thinly sliced red onion.",
    "To serve, place a scoop of the ceviche mixture into each scallop shell and garnish with a lime wedge.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy!",
    "Make sure to consume the ceviche within 24 hours of preparation for food safety reasons."
  ],
